This looks like a partly eaten wrap on a plate. The wrap is a whole wheat tortilla with chicken and lettuce, and the plate also holds a few scattered shreds of carrot, lettuce, and chicken. The cola in the cup is not on the plate, so I left it out.

The remaining wrap is probably about half of the original, roughly 90 g, at about 200 kcal. The loose bits add around 20 g and about 20 kcal. That gives roughly 110 g and 220 kcal in total.

